 happened in 2015,"},{"h":0.011627906668205679,"text":"when a Japanese man decided to cover 7,000 kilometres","x":0.5099778319348931,"y":0.78343023278508317,"w":0.42128601074218752},{"x":0.50997783046858292,"y":0.79787234038923327,"text":"around Japan on foot, by car, ferry, and bicycle.","w":0.35476718902587889,"h":0.011865793780687417},{"w":0.035476717948913605,"h":0.013081395294389231,"x":0.50997782741135256,"text":"He5","y":0.80959302315222392},{"h":0.011865793780687306,"w":0.30376939773559575,"text":"planned his trip very carefully, recording","y":0.8109656302417273,"x":0.61419068536169219},{"h":0.013150382549204753,"text":"each step with GPS technology,®","y":0.82405891953112942,"x":0.50997783377547035,"w":0.2461197280883789},{"y":0.82511835939190781,"x":0.824693873898797,"h":0.011100490042503908,"w":0.075667686462402295,"text":"is used to"},{"x":0.50997783091787685,"h":0.011627906668205679,"w":0.41685142517089835,"text":"monitor the location of things and people. At the end of","y":0.83866279093915297},{"text":"his journey, the GPS drawing spelt out an enormous","y":0.85174418600698232,"x":0.50997783409583552,"w":0.38802658081054686,"h":0.01162790666820579},{"y":0.86482558120454944,"h":0.013243158203100069,"text":"'Marry me!' Was it worth the effort? Judging '","w":0.34146339416503912,"x":0.50997784268096891},{"text":"the fact that he's a married man now, it turned out well!","x":0.5099778384718392,"y":0.88081395393926032,"w":0.41906871795654299,"h":0.010348075345378072},{"text":"This was probably the world's most extraordinary","y":0.89389534891880418,"x":0.50997783767042459,"w":0.37250553131103514,"h":0.011627906668205679},{"text":"proposal. Having said that, no doubt someone will soon","h":0.011865793780687417,"x":0.50997783015291009,"w":0.41685142517089835,"y":0.90834697209524162},{"y":0.92144026193823669,"text":"try to make an ®","x":0.50997783110817552,"w":0.12416851043701171,"h":0.011865793780687417},{"w":0.093126382827758758,"x":0.70066519151294981,"y